msgid "Configuration and tools"
msgstr "配置与工具"

msgid ""
"Use one authored TOML assembly and maintained facts. Unknown keys, "
"unsupported modes and stale inputs are rejected rather than repaired "
"silently."
msgstr "使用一份人工维护的 TOML 装配和已维护的事实。未知键、未支持模式和过期输入被明确拒绝，解析器不静默修复配置。"
